## Templates & Files

### File Resource

**Static Files:**

```ruby
# Copy file from cookbook
cookbook_file '/etc/myapp/config.txt' do
  source 'config.txt'
  owner 'root'
  group 'root'
  mode '0644'
  action :create
end
```

### Template Resource

**Dynamic Files (with ERB):**

```ruby
# Create from template
template '/etc/apache2/apache2.conf' do
  source 'apache2.conf.erb'
  owner 'root'
  group 'root'
  mode '0644'
  variables(
    port: node['apache']['port'],
    user: node['apache']['user'],
    max_clients: node['apache']['max_clients']
  )
  notifies :restart, 'service[apache2]', :delayed
end
```

**Template File (ERB):**

```erb
<!-- templates/apache2.conf.erb -->

# Apache Configuration
Listen <%= @port %>

<IfModule mpm_prefork_module>
  StartServers <%= @max_clients / 2 %>
  MaxRequestWorkers <%= @max_clients %>
</IfModule>

User <%= @user %>
Group <%= @user %>

# Load modules
LoadModule ssl_module modules/mod_ssl.so
LoadModule rewrite_module modules/mod_rewrite.so

# Virtual hosts
Include /etc/apache2/sites-enabled/*.conf
```

**Template with Loops:**

```erb
<!-- Database configuration -->
<% node['databases'].each do |db| %>
Database: <%= db['name'] %>
Host: <%= db['host'] %>
Port: <%= db['port'] %>
<% end %>
```

**Template with Conditionals:**

```erb
<!-- Optional SSL configuration -->
<% if @ssl_enabled %>
<VirtualHost *:<%= @ssl_port %>>
  SSLEngine on
  SSLCertificateFile <%= @cert_file %>
  SSLCertificateKeyFile <%= @key_file %>
</VirtualHost>
<% end %>
```

