## Advanced Patterns

### Pattern 1: Blue-Green Deployment

**Theory: Zero-downtime updates**

```
BLUE ENVIRONMENT (Current)         GREEN ENVIRONMENT (New)
├─ Version 1 running               ├─ Version 2 deployed
├─ All traffic → Blue              ├─ Not receiving traffic
└─ Load balancer points here       └─ Ready to switch

Deployment Process:
1. Deploy to Green
2. Test Green thoroughly
3. Switch load balancer
4. Blue becomes standby
5. Quick rollback if needed
```

**Chef Implementation:**

```ruby
# recipes/blue_green_deploy.rb

# Get current active environment
current_env = node['deployment']['active_env'] # 'blue' or 'green'
target_env = current_env == 'blue' ? 'green' : 'blue'

# Deploy to inactive environment
directory "/var/www/#{target_env}" do
  recursive true
  owner 'www-data'
  group 'www-data'
end

git "/var/www/#{target_env}" do
  repository node['app']['repository']
  revision node['app']['version']
  action :sync
end

execute "install-deps-#{target_env}" do
  command "cd /var/www/#{target_env} && bundle install --deployment"
  user 'www-data'
end

execute "migrate-db-#{target_env}" do
  command "cd /var/www/#{target_env} && bundle exec rake db:migrate"
  only_if { target_env == 'green' && node['deployment']['first_green'] }
end

# Test the new environment
ruby_block 'test-new-environment' do
  block do
    require 'net/http'
    
    3.times do |attempt|
      begin
        response = Net::HTTP.get_response(
          URI("http://localhost:#{8000 + (target_env == 'green' ? 1 : 0)}/health")
        )
        if response.code == '200'
          Chef::Log.info("#{target_env} environment health check passed")
          break
        end
      rescue
        sleep 5 if attempt < 2
      end
    end
  end
end

# Switch load balancer
template '/etc/nginx/sites-available/default' do
  source 'nginx-blue-green.conf.erb'
  variables(
    active_port: target_env == 'green' ? 8001 : 8000
  )
  notifies :reload, 'service[nginx]'
end

# Update node data
node.override['deployment']['active_env'] = target_env
node.override['deployment']['first_green'] = false

# Notify success
ruby_block 'log-deployment' do
  block do
    Chef::Log.info("Deployment complete. Active env: #{target_env}")
  end
end
```

